## Post-Migration Tasks

Immediate Checks

- Submit updated sitemap to GSC.
- Request indexing for key pages.
- Monitor for 404 spikes.

Ongoing Monitoring

- Weekly reports for 1-3 months.
- Fix issues promptly (e.g., broken links, slow pages).
- Plan redirect cleanup: After 6-12 months, remove low-value redirects if no hits/backlinks.

## Criteria for Redirect Removal

- No external backlinks (check Ahrefs).
- New URL fully indexed and performing.
- Low/no traffic to old URL.

Verify: New URLs indexed? Old URLs return 301? No ranking drops on core terms?

